          "_name": "extFeatures41",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"extFeatures\" group=\"Additional Blocks\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Main Title\" name=\"showmainTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Card Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icons Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#232323\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icons BG\" name=\"iconBg\" value=\"#efeeee\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Cards 1 BG\" name=\"cardsBg1\" value=\"#232323\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Cards 2 BG\" name=\"cardsBg2\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"cardsAmount > 1\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Cards 3 BG\" name=\"cardsBg3\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"cardsAmount > 2\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Cards 4 BG\" name=\"cardsBg4\" value=\"#232323\" condition=\"cardsAmount > 3\">\n        <select title=\"Cards\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\" selected>3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n        </select>\n\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"../images/background3.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#efefef\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay&&bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay&&bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay&&bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n\n        <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-semibold mbr-white align-center pb-3 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showmainTitle\">Featured Programs</h1>\n\n\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\" mbr-cards=\"bootstrap\">\n            <div class=\"card p-3 col-12 col-md-8\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-6': cardsAmount == '2',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3', 'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4'}\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper card1\">\n                    <div class=\"img-wrap\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/factory-workshop-interior-machines-1-min-818x584.webp\" alt=\"Industrial\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title title1 pb-1 align-left mbr-white mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".title1\"><b>INDUSTRIAL</b></h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text align-left text1 mbr-regular mbr-white mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".text1\"><i>Servicios profesionales a la medida<br></i><br>Nuestros contratistas certificados en Industrial han ayudado a innumerables clientes a descubrir los beneficios de trabajar con C&amp;C soluciones en diseño y construcción.<br><br>Personalizamos nuestros servicios para cumplir las necesidades particulares de cada proyecto garantizando calidad, eficiencia y ahorro a nuestros clientes.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <a href=\"#\"><span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont icon fa-industry fa\"></span></a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"card col2 p-3 col-12 col-md-8\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-6': cardsAmount == '2',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3', 'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4'}\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper card2\">\n                    <div class=\"img-wrap\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/beautiful-skyscraper-with-architecture-and-building-around-city-min-818x614.webp\" alt=\"Comercial\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title title2 pb-1 align-left mbr-white mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".title2\"><b>COMERCIAL</b></h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text align-left text2 mbr-regular mbr-white mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".text2\"><i>Servicio inigualable</i><br><br>Nuestro objetivo es hacer bien cualquier trabajo que nos encomienden. Aunque este tipo de proyectos pueden ser complicados, con la experiencia de una empresa como C&amp;C soluciones en diseño y construcción todo es más fácil. A lo largo de los años, nos hemos convertido en uno de los contratistas más confiables combinando una planificación eficaz y las mejores prácticas de gestión.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <a href=\"#\"><span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont icon fa-building fa\"></span></a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card col3 p-3 col-md-8\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 2\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                             'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3', 'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4'}\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper card3\">\n                    <div class=\"img-wrap\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/exterior-of-modern-apartment-buildings-o-min-818x545.webp\" alt=\"Residencial\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title title3 pb-1 align-left mbr-white mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".title3\">\n                            <b>RESIDENCIAL</b></h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text align-left text3 mbr-regular mbr-white mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".text3\"><i>Lo que usted necesita</i><br><br>En C&amp;C soluciones en diseño y construcción entendemos las necesidades del sector Residencial. Nuestro equipo de especialistas ofrece soluciones inigualables y personalizadas para todo tipo de necesidades y a un precio competitivo.<br><br>​De aquí radica nuestro estandarte <i>\"Tu lo sueñas, nosotros lo hacemos realidad\"</i></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <a href=\"#\"><span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont icon fa-home fa\" style=\"font-size: 26px;\"></span></a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card col4 p-3 col-md-8 col-lg-3\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 3\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper card4\">\n                    <div class=\"img-wrap\">\n                        <img src=\"../_images/img/35.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"card-box\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title title4 pb-1 align-left mbr-white mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".title4\"><b>POLITICS</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text align-left text4 mbr-regular mbr-white mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".text4\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet,\n                            consectetur adipiscing elit</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <a href=\"#\"><span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont icon mobi-mbri-right mobi-mbri\"></span></a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "srR7Xk1HDq",
          "_anchor": "extFeatures41-0",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 15px)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 15px)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".content-block": {
              "max-width": "700px",
              "padding": "4rem 3rem"
            },
            ".img-content": {
              "position": "absolute",
              "width": "100%",
              "bottom": "0",
              "left": "0",
              "height": "100%",
              "opacity": "0",
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "flex-end",
              "align-items": "center",
              "transition": "all 0.3s",
              "transition-delay": "0s",
              "background-image": "url(@img)",
              "background-position": "center",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "z-index": "3"
            },
            ".block2": {
              "background": "@color2",
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "center"
            },
            "p": {
              "margin-left": "10rem",
              "max-width": "450px"
            },
            ".overlay": {
              "position": "absolute",
              "transition": "all 0.3s",
              "transition-delay": "0.3s",
              "width": "0%",
              "height": "100%",
              "top": "0",
              "right": "0%",
              "background": "@color",
              "z-index": "2",
              "opacity": "1"
            },
            ".box-title2, .box-text2": {
              "transition": "all 0.3s",
              "transition-delay": "0s"
            },
            ".overlay-wrapper": {
              "width": "50%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "right": "50%",
              "transition-delay": "0.3s",
              "top": "0",
              "z-index": "4"
            },
            ".col": {
              "padding": "0",
              "display": "flex",
              "position": "relative",
              "min-height": "400px",
              "justify-content": "flex-end",
              "&:hover": {
                ".overlay-wrapper": {
                  "width": "100%",
                  "right": "0",
                  "transition-delay": "0s"
                },
                ".overlay": {
                  "width": "100%",
                  "transition-delay": "0s"
                },
                ".img-content": {
                  "opacity": "1",
                  "width": "100%",
                  "transition-delay": "0.3s"
                },
                ".box-title2, .box-text2": {
                  "color": "@hover",
                  "transition-delay": "0.3s"
                }
              }
            },
            ".box-content": {
              "width": "50%",
              "height": "100%",
              "transition": "all 0.3s",
              "position": "relative",
              "display": "flex",
              "flex-direction": "column",
              "align-items": "flex-end",
              "background": "@color"
            },
            ".content1": {
              "z-index": "5",
              "max-width": "450px",
              "position": "relative",
              "transition": "all 0.3s",
              "transition-delay": "0.3s",
              "padding": "4rem 3rem"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
              ".img-content": {
                "opacity": "1"
              },
              ".overlay-wrapper": {
                "width": "100%",
                "right": "0"
              },
              ".box-content": {
                "width": "100%"
              },
              ".box-title2, .box-text2": {
                "color": "@hover !important"
              },
              "p": {
                "margin-left": "0"
              },
              ".content-block, .content1": {
                "padding": "3rem 1rem"
              }
            },
            ".box-text1": {
              "color": "#333333"
            },
            ".box-title2": {
              "color": "#767676"
            },
            ".box-text2": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#fafafa"
            },
            "H2": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            "H3": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            }
          },
          "_name": "features003",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"header1\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n                    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Subtitle\" name=\"showSubTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Show Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <input type=\"image\" name=\"img\" title=\"Block Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/future-building-construction-engineering-project-648x250.webp\" parallax>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"color\" title=\"Left Block Color\" value=\"#111111\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"color2\" title=\"Right Block Color\" value=\"#be1621\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"hover\" title=\"Text Hover Color\" value=\"#333333\" selected>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/two-engineers-work-construction-site-min-2-1050x700.webp\" parallax selected>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#efeeee\">\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#282124\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"container-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col align-left\">\n                <div class=\"overlay-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"overlay\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"img-content\">\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"box-content\">\n                    <div class=\"content1\">\n                        <h4 class=\"box-title2 mbr-medium mbr-white pb-2 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".box-title2\">Diseño / Construcción</h4>\n                        <h3 class=\"box-text2 mbr-regular mbr-white pb-2 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".box-text2\">Quiénes somos</h3>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 block2 align-left\">\n                <div class=\"content-block\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-regular mbr-black pb-2 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubTitle\"><b>Precisión</b> / Puntualidad / Profesionalismo</h3>\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-semibold mbr-black pb-4 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 2.6rem;\">La calidad, nuestro compromiso</span><br></div></h2>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-black mbr-regular mbr-light mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Somos un equipo de profesionales certificados capaces de materializar cualquier proyecto independientemente de su complejidad. Nos motiva el compromiso con la excelencia e invertimos el esfuerzo y tiempo necesarios para conseguir la completa satisfacción de nuestros clientes.<br>\n                    </p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn pt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-lg btn-white-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">READ MORE</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
